{{ r6_dosecompass.json : results.B=3.planner_posterior_p_active.brier_dosecompass | .3f }}, against
{{ r6_dosecompass.json : results.B=3.planner_posterior_p_active.brier_constant_base_rate | .3f }} for the base rate.
