DNT-positive from DNT-negative reference chemicals. It does not: AUROC
{{ r5_selectivity.json : auroc_selectivity_index | .3f }} \ci{ {{ r5_selectivity.json : auroc_si_ci95.0 | .3f }} }{ {{ r5_selectivity.json : auroc_si_ci95.1 | .3f }} },
